# 统一换行：文本一律 LF 入库，避免 Windows/macOS 协作产生整文件 diff
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制：不做换行转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary

# 锁文件与快照：diff 无意义，但**必须入库**（保证可复现）
pnpm-lock.yaml -diff linguist-generated
fixtures/sample-result.json -diff linguist-generated

# 中文文档在 GitHub 上按 Markdown 渲染
*.md text linguist-documentation
